{"suttaId":"thig6.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Thī","vriCode":"s0509m.mul","paras":[529,547],"vripara":"133"},"segments":{"thig6.2:0.3":"Vāseṭṭhītherīgāthā","thig6.2:1.1":"“Puttasokenahaṃ aṭṭā, khittacittā visaññinī;","thig6.2:1.3":"Naggā pakiṇṇakesī ca, tena tena vicārihaṃ.","thig6.2:2.1":"“Vīthi [vasiṃ (sī.)] saṅkārakūṭesu, susāne rathiyāsu ca;","thig6.2:2.3":"Acariṃ tīṇi vassāni, khuppipāsāsamappitā.","thig6.2:3.1":"“Athaddasāsiṃ sugataṃ, nagaraṃ mithilaṃ pati [gataṃ (ka.)];","thig6.2:3.3":"Adantānaṃ dametāraṃ, sambuddhamakutobhayaṃ.","thig6.2:4.1":"“Sacittaṃ paṭiladdhāna, vanditvāna upāvisiṃ;","thig6.2:4.3":"So me dhammamadesesi, anukampāya gotamo.","thig6.2:5.1":"“Tassa dhammaṃ suṇitvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thig6.2:5.3":"Yuñjantī satthuvacane, sacchākāsiṃ padaṃ sivaṃ.","thig6.2:6.1":"“Sabbe sokā samucchinnā, pahīnā etadantikā;","thig6.2:6.3":"Pariññātā hi me vatthū, yato sokāna sambhavo”ti.","thig6.2:7.1":"… Vāseṭṭhī therī …."},"attha":{"book":"Thī-a","bookName":"Therīgāthā-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0509a.att","from":1890,"to":1890,"paras":[{"para":1890,"vripara":null,"refs":["thig6.2:6"],"lines":["<b>Etadantikā</b>ti etaṃ idāni mayā adhigataṃ arahattaṃ anto pariyosānaṃ etesanti etadantikā, sokā.","Na dāni tesaṃ sambhavo atthīti attho.","<b>Yato sokāna sambhavo</b>ti yato antonijjhānalakkhaṇānaṃ sokānaṃ sambhavo, tesaṃ sokānaṃ pañcupādānakkhandhasaṅkhātā vatthū adhiṭṭhānāni ñātatīraṇapahānapariññāhi pariññātā.","Tasmā sokā etadantikāti yojanā."],"lineRefs":[["thig6.2:6"],["thig6.2:6"],["thig6.2:6"],["thig6.2:6"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thig6.2:6.1","etadantikā",0,0],["thig6.2:6.3","yato sokāna sambhavo",0,2]]},"tika":null}
